---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import { pricingPlans } from '../data/site';
import '../styles/global.css';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<BaseLayout>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="rental-home">
    <div class="container returning-renter" data-returning-renter hidden><div><strong>Welcome back.</strong><span>Your flights, hours, and payments are in your renter portal.</span></div><a class="button button-small" href={`${base}account/`}>Open Renter Portal →</a></div>
    <section class="rental-hero container">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">AIRCRAFT RENTAL · KWDR · WINDER, GA</p><h1>Aircraft rental.<br />Winder, Georgia.</h1><p class="rental-lead">Piper Cherokee rental at Winder–Barrow Airport (KWDR) for Northeast Georgia pilots, from Atlanta to Athens. Check the schedule, review wet rates, and start renter approval.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="button" href={`${base}availability/`}>Schedule a Flight <Icon name="calendar" size={20}/></a><a class="button button-outline" href={`${base}account/#payments`}>Hours &amp; Payments</a></div><p class="rental-qualification">For approved renters. Every reservation requires Tyler’s confirmation.</p><a class="text-link" href={`${base}apply/`} data-renter-action data-unapproved-label="New renter? Start your application" data-approved-label="View My Flights" data-unapproved-href={`${base}apply/`} data-approved-href={`${base}account/#flights`}><span data-renter-action-label>New renter? Start your application</span> →</a></div>
      <figure class="rental-aircraft"><img src={`${base}images/n8491f-hero.jpg`} alt="Hutzell Aviation Piper Cherokee N8491F parked at the airport" width="1536" height="1024" fetchpriority="high" decoding="async"/><figcaption><span><strong>Piper PA-28-140</strong>N8491F · 1974 Cherokee</span><a href={`${base}aircraft/`}>Meet the aircraft →</a></figcaption></figure>
    </section>
    <section class="rental-rates container" aria-labelledby="home-rates"><div class="portal-section-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">FLIGHT HOURS</p><h2 id="home-rates">Fly at your pace.</h2><p>Wet rates include fuel. Prepaid blocks expire in three months.</p></div><a class="text-link" href={`${base}pricing/`}>View rates and terms →</a></div><div class="rental-rate-grid">{pricingPlans.map(plan => <article><span>{plan.name}</span><h3>{plan.rate}</h3><p>{plan.total}</p></article>)}</div></section>
    <section class="rental-start container"><div><p class="eyebrow">NEW TO HUTZELL AVIATION?</p><h2>A straightforward start.</h2><p>Our 1974 Piper Cherokee is being prepared for rental at Barrow County Airport. Review the requirements, submit your application, and complete your aircraft checkout with Tyler.</p><a class="text-link" href={`${base}aircraft/#requirements`}>Renter requirements →</a></div><ol><li><span>01</span><div><h3>Create your account</h3><p>Submit pilot details and your renter application.</p></div></li><li><span>02</span><div><h3>Get approved</h3><p>Complete document review and the required check flight.</p></div></li><li><span>03</span><div><h3>Choose your next flight</h3><p>Request a time window and manage billing in your portal.</p></div></li></ol></section>
    <section class="section" aria-labelledby="local-flying">
      <div class="container">
        <p class="eyebrow">NORTHEAST GEORGIA AIRCRAFT RENTAL</p>
        <h2 id="local-flying">Based in Winder. Welcoming pilots from Atlanta to Athens.</h2>
        <p>Hutzell Aviation is preparing a 1974 Piper PA-28-140 Cherokee for rental at Winder–Barrow Airport, also known as Barrow County Airport, in Winder, Georgia. KWDR is the aircraft’s home base for qualified pilots looking for personal flying and time-building options in Northeast Georgia.</p>
        <p>Whether you live in the Atlanta area, Athens, Lawrenceville, Dacula, Buford, Jefferson, or Monroe, rental begins with approval and aircraft checkout in Winder. The aircraft normally departs from and returns to KWDR; another arrangement requires Tyler’s approval.</p>
        <h3>Wet rental rates and time-building blocks</h3>
        <p>Choose pay-as-you-go flying or a prepaid 15-, 25-, or 50-hour block. All published rates include fuel, and prepaid blocks expire three months after purchase. Compare <a href={`${base}pricing/`}>aircraft rental rates and terms</a>, explore <a href={`${base}aircraft/`}>N8491F’s equipment and renter requirements</a>, or <a href={`${base}availability/`}>view aircraft availability at KWDR</a>.</p>
        <h3>Talk with Tyler before your first rental</h3>
        <p>Call <a href="tel:+14044010041">(404) 401-0041</a> to discuss renter approval, the required check flight, and meeting at tie-down spot #10. Hutzell Aviation provides aircraft rental for approved pilots; it does not operate a flight school. Each reservation requires Tyler’s confirmation.</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="rental-about container"><div><h2>Local aircraft. Personal support.</h2><p>Learn about Tyler, Hutzell Aviation, and flying from KWDR.</p></div><a class="button button-outline" href={`${base}about/`}>About Hutzell Aviation</a></section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
